     C06GQF(3NAG)      Foundation Library (12/10/92)      C06GQF(3NAG)



          C06 -- Summation of Series                                 C06GQF
                  C06GQF -- NAG Foundation Library Routine Document

          Note: Before using this routine, please read the Users' Note for
